@host = http://localhost:5103

### No key - limited by IP (5 per minute). Send this 6 times to get a 429
GET {{host}}/api/exchange-rates

### Basic merchant key (20 per minute)
GET {{host}}/api/exchange-rates/usd
X-Api-Key: basic-3f9a1c

### Unknown key -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/exchange-rates
X-Api-Key: not-a-real-key
